SecretScanner
Scans files and folders for hardcoded secrets like API keys, passwords, tokens, and private keys.

Installation
cd SecretScanner
Requires Python 3.8+

Usage
python secret_scanner.py <path_to_scan> [options]
Example
python secret_scanner.py . --mask --json report.json

Options
--mask           Mask secrets in output
--json <file>    Save results to JSON
--debug          Enable debug logging
--exclude <dirs> Skip folders or files
--no-recursive   Do not scan subfolders

Supported secrets: AWS keys, Google API keys, JWT, private keys, passwords

Visual Studio: add ". --mask" to script arguments and press F5
